2026-10-13T16:05:59.3905588Z   * test the hook path: what Plug.Telemetry + RenderErrors actually sample (D132) a 500 raised INSIDE the router lands with the request's FULL duration and ticks the 5xx rate [L#632]16:05:59.390 [warning] studio chat agent-state sweeper: sweep failed: cannot find ownership process for #PID<0.453.0> (Barkpark.StudioChat.AgentStateSweeper)
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3907718Z using mode :manual.
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3908364Z (Note that a connection's mode reverts to :manual if its owner
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3908934Z terminates.)
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3909214Z 
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3909629Z When using ownership, you must manage connections in one
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3910175Z of the four ways:
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3910450Z 
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3910770Z * By explicitly checking out a connection
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3911327Z * By explicitly allowing a spawned process
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3911888Z * By running the pool in shared mode
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3912695Z * By using :caller option with allowed process
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3913115Z 
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3913530Z The first two options require every new process to explicitly
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3914235Z check a connection out or be allowed by calling checkout or
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3914803Z allow respectively.
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3915082Z 
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3915482Z The third option requires a {:shared, pid} mode to be set.
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3916170Z If using shared mode in tests, make sure your tests are not
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3916681Z async.
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3916930Z 
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3917291Z The fourth option requires [caller: pid] to be used when
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3917907Z checking out a connection from the pool. The caller process
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3918474Z should already be allowed on a connection.
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3918806Z 
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3919283Z If you are reading this error, it means you have not done one
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3919926Z of the steps above or that the owner process has crashed.
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3920302Z 
2026-10-13T16:05:59.3920667Z See Ecto.Adapters.SQL.Sandbox docs for more information.
